# EtStory Component

## Purpose & Scope

`EtStory` is a circular avatar component for the eToro design system. It displays a circular avatar (for instruments or users) with a label below, supporting a "watched" state indicator via a green ring border.

**Features:**

- **Circular avatar**: 56x56px avatar with image (uses `EtAvatar` internally)
- **Variant support**: `default` (no overlay, for users) or `instrument` (gradient overlay, for stocks/crypto)
- **Unwatched indicator**: Green ring border (64x64px) when story hasn't been watched yet
- **Loading state**: Animated rotating arc while content is loading
- **Loading complete animation**: Avatar "pop" scale animation when loading finishes
- **Label support**: Text label below avatar (e.g., "TSLA")
- **Press interaction**: Optional onPress callback
- **Compound component pattern**: `EtStory.Label` subcomponent

**Does NOT handle:**

- Navigation logic (use with router/navigation handlers)
- Story content/preview (handle in parent)
- Multiple story management (handle selection state in parent)

## Entry Points & Contracts

### `EtStory` (main component)

```tsx
<EtStory
  imageSource: string           // required - image URL for avatar
  variant?: 'default' | 'instrument'  // default: 'default' - 'instrument' adds gradient overlay
  watched?: boolean             // default: false - ring shows when false (unwatched)
  loading?: boolean             // default: false - shows animated loading ring
  onPress?: () => void         // optional - callback when pressed
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
  accessibilityLabel?: string
>
  <EtStory.Label>{children}</EtStory.Label>  // required
</EtStory>
```

**Children constraints:**

- Required: `EtStory.Label` must be provided as child
- Only `EtStory.Label` is allowed as child (throws error for other children)
- Label text is extracted from `EtStory.Label` for accessibility purposes

### `EtStory.Label`

```tsx
<EtStory.Label
  style?: StyleProp<TextStyle>
>
  {ReactNode}
</EtStory.Label>
```

## Usage Patterns

### User story (default variant)

```tsx
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/user.jpg" onPress={() => console.log('Story pressed')}>
  <EtStory.Label>Sarah</EtStory.Label>
</EtStory>
```

### Instrument story (with gradient overlay)

```tsx
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/tsla.png" variant="instrument" onPress={() => console.log('Story pressed')}>
  <EtStory.Label>TSLA</EtStory.Label>
</EtStory>
```

### Watched state

```tsx
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/tsla.png" variant="instrument" watched={true}>
  <EtStory.Label>TSLA</EtStory.Label>
</EtStory>
```

### Multiple stories (typical use case)

```tsx
const stories = [
  { id: '1', image: 'tsla.png', label: 'TSLA', watched: false, variant: 'instrument' },
  { id: '2', image: 'user.jpg', label: 'John', watched: true, variant: 'default' },
];

{
  stories.map((story) => (
    <EtStory key={story.id} imageSource={story.image} variant={story.variant} watched={story.watched} onPress={() => handleStoryPress(story.id)}>
      <EtStory.Label>{story.label}</EtStory.Label>
    </EtStory>
  ));
}
```

## Anti-patterns

### ❌ Using EtStory without EtStory.Label

```tsx
// BAD - EtStory.Label is required
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/tsla.png" />
```

**Fix:** Always provide EtStory.Label as child:

```tsx
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/tsla.png">
  <EtStory.Label>TSLA</EtStory.Label>
</EtStory>
```

### ❌ Using invalid children

```tsx
// BAD - only EtStory.Label is allowed
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/tsla.png">
  <Text>TSLA</Text>
</EtStory>
```

**Fix:** Use EtStory.Label for the label:

```tsx
<EtStory imageSource="https://example.com/tsla.png">
  <EtStory.Label>TSLA</EtStory.Label>
</EtStory>
```

### ❌ Manually styling colors

```tsx
// BAD - bypasses design system
<EtStory.Label style={{ color: 'red' }}>TSLA</EtStory.Label>
```

**Fix:** Colors are automatically managed based on theme.

## Dependencies & Edges

### Internal Dependencies

- `useEtoroTheme` - provides theme colors for styling
- `EtText` - underlying text component for `StoryLabel`
- `EtAvatar` - used for avatar rendering with variant support (handles gradient overlay internally)

### External Dependencies

- `react-native` - `Pressable`, `View`, `StyleSheet`
- `react-native-reanimated` - avatar pop animation
- `react-native-svg` - gradient ring indicators

### Design System Integration

- Colors come from theme (`useEtoroTheme().colors`):
  - Ring gradient: `colors.positiveGradientPrimary50` to `colors.positiveGradientPrimary70`
  - Label color: `colors.textPrimaryNeutral`
  - Avatar background: `colors.bgNeutralTertiary` (theme-aware)
  - Gradient overlay (instrument variant): handled by `EtAvatar` with `variant="instrument"`
- Sizes:
  - Avatar: 56x56px
  - Ring: 64x64px (2px gap + 2px border on each side)
  - Container: 64px wide
- Typography: `num-xxs` variant with `weight="semiBold"` (10px, semibold, primary color)

## Patterns & Pitfalls

### Watched State

The watched state is controlled by the `watched` prop:

- `watched={false}` - shows green ring border (story is unwatched/new)
- `watched={true}` - no ring (story has been watched)

The ring acts as an "unread indicator" - it appears when the story hasn't been watched yet and disappears once the user has watched it. The ring is positioned absolutely behind the avatar.

### Loading State

The loading state shows an animated spinner ring (similar to Instagram):

- `loading={true}` - shows animated rotating arc
- `loading={false}` - normal behavior (based on watched state)

**Loading takes precedence over watched state.** When loading, the animated ring is always shown regardless of the `watched` value.

While loading:

- The component is non-interactive (onPress won't fire)
- Accessibility state includes `busy: true`

**Loading complete animation:** When `loading` transitions from `true` to `false`, the avatar plays a subtle "pop" animation (scales up to 1.08x then back to 1x) to provide feedback that loading has finished.

### Press Handling

- `onPress` is optional - if not provided, component is not pressable
- Component uses `Pressable` with `accessibilityRole="button"`

### Image Loading

- Uses `EtAvatar` with `EtAvatar.Image` and `contentFit="cover"`
- Handles invalid URLs gracefully (does not crash)
- Avatar uses a theme-aware background color (`colors.bgNeutralTertiary`) that shows if the image fails to load

### Variant

The `variant` prop controls the avatar styling:

- `variant="default"` (default) - No gradient overlay, suitable for user avatars
- `variant="instrument"` - Adds gradient overlay, suitable for instrument/stock logos

This prop is passed directly to the underlying `EtAvatar` component.

### Label Rendering

- `EtStory.Label` is required as child
- Label is centered below avatar with 5px spacing
- Label text is truncated to single line with `numberOfLines={1}`
- Label text is extracted for accessibility label generation

